{"summary":"Escape the depths of an otherworldly labyrinth in this cinematic platformer.","description":"-PLAY THE FIRST CHAPTER FOR FREE-\nDive into the haunting world of INMOST with the free demo, and experience its chilling atmosphere, eerie puzzles, and gripping story. You can unlock the full experience from a one-time in-app purchase in the main menu to play uninterrupted, or test the depths of the darkness before committing, and see if you’re ready to face what lies within…\n\nEscape the depths of an otherworldly labyrinth, in INMOST, a cinematic puzzle platformer. \n\nExplore the hauntingly beautiful world of three playable characters, in one dark, interconnected story. A knight adventures into the depths of a deteriorating castle. A child uncovers the past of an eerie house. A wanderer searches for answers. \n\nWithin a crumbling, nightmarish landscape, slice through enemies, and spring deadly traps in order to escape the evil that awaits… \n\nFEATURES\n■ Venture through a hauntingly atmospheric pixel art world.\n■ 3 main characters, each with their own unique gameplay styles.\n■ Lure enemies into lethal traps, solve environmental puzzles and utilise your scythe, hookshot and pickaxe to avoid a gruesome end!\n■ Discover a 3-5 hour emotional story, intended to be played in a single-sitting on a dark, stormy night.\n■ Explore every nook and cranny to find secret passages and collectibles.\n■ Playable in 14 languages.\n■ Each pixel is placed with love!","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence, Horror","iapPrices":"$4.49 - $6.49 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z21v_Ausk7s?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wzDtncwK5bqwZsfwS7yfzoOhjxGqkTdysJlw2Wkg8rsqKS1JHiDXhdrfENlFQ_0sKr2gkhRKSRQlg-AITeMj","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RLjuwLqHXhug9nFAXzrNsqcKW-LT0iD-t4ZTaU8skaRItzamDoWDZFupWJGYo4ZlcEsG1S2RUvFyD4G5EjqYaw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/u7UTRv